# Product Monorepo Template (Rust + TypeScript + Svelte 5)

> **Build one software product once — ship it across API servers, Desktop, Mobile, Browser Extensions, and Docs from a single Rust + TypeScript (Svelte 5) monorepo (`v{{ version }}`).**

This repository is a ready-to-clone **multi-platform software product monorepo template** combining:

- **Rust core & transport-independent services** (`rust/crates/*`, `rust/adapters/*` — {{ rust_crate_count }} core crates and {{ rust_adapter_count }} thin adapters) compiled natively for servers and desktop/mobile apps, and to **WebAssembly (WASM)** for browsers and extensions.
- **TypeScript contracts, application client, and injectable infrastructure** (`packages/*` — {{ ts_package_count }} workspace packages) built with strict TypeScript, Bun, and zero-global-coupling adapters so every platform boundary is unit-testable without a WebView, browser, or live server.
- **Shared Svelte 5 UI** (`packages/frontend/{ui,features}`) styled with **UnoCSS** and headless primitives (**Bits UI / Zag.js**), reused across Desktop, Mobile, and Browser Extensions.
- **Hard architectural & supply-chain guardrails** enforced automatically through `alint`, `biome`, `clippy`, `cargo-deny`, `cargo-audit`, `gherlint`, `lychee`, `rumdl`, `vale`, and `pixi`.

